/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3707336968","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114297#issuecomment-3707336968","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114297","id":3707336968,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7c-XkI","user":{"login":"billuo","id":43804776,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODA0Nzc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43804776?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo","html_url":"https://github.com/billuo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/billuo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-03T20:33:18Z","updated_at":"2026-01-03T20:33:18Z","body":"1a1711f1ee0fd4b64bc0a2c35f409428dcc05fcb changed where double clicking with LMB will create a new scene, likely by accident.\n\n```diff\n--- a/editor/scene/editor_scene_tabs.cpp\n+++ b/editor/scene/editor_scene_tabs.cpp\n@@ -128,7 +128,7 @@ void EditorSceneTabs::_scene_tab_input(const Ref<InputEvent> &p_input) {\n \tRef<InputEventMouseButton> mb = p_input;\n \n \tif (mb.is_valid()) {\n-\t\tif (mb->get_button_index() == MouseButton::LEFT && mb->is_double_click()) {\n+\t\tif (scene_tabs->get_hovered_tab() < 0 && mb->get_button_index() == MouseButton::LEFT && mb->is_double_click()) {\n \t\t\tint tab_buttons = 0;\n \t\t\tif (scene_tabs->get_offset_buttons_visible()) {\n \t\t\t\ttab_buttons = get_theme_icon(SNAME(\"increment\"), SNAME(\"TabBar\"))->get_width() + get_theme_icon(SNAME(\"decrement\"), SNAME(\"TabBar\"))->get_width();\n```\nThis will restore it to only creating new scenes when not hovering any scene tabs, that is in the empty area","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3707336968/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3707349461","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114297#issuecomment-3707349461","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114297","id":3707349461,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7c-anV","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-03T20:53:38Z","updated_at":"2026-01-03T20:53:38Z","body":"CC @cruglet @KoBeWi \n\nThe change was made in 4.5 so not critical to solve for the 4.6 release, but probably worth doing anyway if we agree this is an unintended change.